


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_ff1bd536:



    voice "d/2FU_1250"
    fumi "「那条丝带是红底然后有金色刺绣花边的，很可爱吧？非常衬你喔」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_fb7689ae:


    "文一脸满足地俯视着伦的后背。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_8ea28ebc:



    voice "d/2FU_1251"
    fumi "「伦平时走的是帅气路线，没怎么做过可爱的打扮对吧？所以我就想着偶尔也想看看伦系上丝带的样子」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_0dd2be06:



    voice "d/2RI_1660"
    rin "「……丝带这个毕竟是我自己说过的所以这锅我背了。可这个不对吧？这个不是『系上去』而是『绑起来』啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_0f8f30b8:



    voice "d/2FU_1252"
    fumi "「啊，丝带的绑法可是额外服务哦？伦你不是喜欢被欺负的嘛。所以我觉得这样的话一定很合你心意吧」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_adb20637:



    voice "d/2RI_1661"
    rin "「你、你坦然自若地说什么呢！？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_791cdc27:



    voice "d/2FU_1253"
    fumi "「伦前阵子看的书里面也有这样的……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_e4b36f40:



    voice "d/2RI_1662"
    rin "「文、文你不准擅自翻我的书！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_471dcde2:



    voice "d/2FU_1254"
    fumi "「你嘴上是那么说，可我知道你是故意放在很显眼的地方喔？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_e8384f9a:


    "这孩子露出温顺表情的同时举止却越来越无情了啊。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_7de8d732:



    voice "d/2RI_1663"
    rin "「呜……才没有那么一回事嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_80ea4523:


    "这边也变得越来越容易陷入死鸭子嘴硬的状态了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_c8fdd8e5:


    "咕啾。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_d7fc4bac:


    "就在文将伦的脚抬起来的那一刻，伦大腿的根部传来了水声。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_16767557:



    voice "d/2RI_1664"
    rin "「呜……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_ac4ec791:


    "伦唰得把脸别了过去，聪明的她马上就明白有什么事暴露给文知道了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_15337dae:



    voice "d/2FU_1255"
    fumi "「诶嘿嘿嘿～～」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_ac07f953:


    "文看起来似乎一脸愉悦的样子啊。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_24d61910:


    "估计把脸给藏了起来的伦看不见吧，文只有在两人独处的时候才会露出这样的表情。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_a9bd3c5f:



    voice "d/2RI_1665"
    rin "「呜呜……文越来越会使坏了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_77975b3e:


    "这位渴望受虐的女孩儿话中夹着泪水地说道。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_857c6273:



    voice "d/2FU_1256"
    fumi "「来，我们开始吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_b78b46ca:


    "文说着便温柔地抚摸起伦的大腿。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_38764ff4:



    voice "d/2RI_1666"
    rin "「咦……？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_da13df17:



    voice "d/2FU_1257"
    fumi "「怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_5b696dba:



    voice "d/2RI_1667"
    rin "「还以为你会继续挑逗我来着……结果让我有点心里没谱啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_ab6a0f38:



    voice "d/2FU_1258"
    fumi "「抱歉啊，今天恐怕是不行了。因为我似乎也忍不住了……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_e798df66:



    voice "d/2RI_1668"
    rin "「没关系……按文喜欢的来就好」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_b58707dc:



    voice "d/2FU_1259"
    fumi "「还是说你希望我挑逗一下？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_b8102086:



    voice "d/2RI_1669"
    rin "「呃……我、我倒是没有那个想法啦」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_9e41964c:


    "绪方伦自掘坟墓的功夫已经炉火纯青。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_c1f76ed3:


    "文挺进了腰部，使彼此的花瓣紧密地相贴在一起。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_fbd9fdc1:



    voice "d/2FU_1260"
    fumi "「哇……伦的这里，好热！感觉快要被烫伤了……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_c0f2b3b8:



    voice "d/2RI_1670"
    rin "「文、文那里，也快要让我……融化掉了……啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_f952c86b:



    voice "d/2FU_1261"
    fumi "「毕竟……实在是太久没做了嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_73dfe9c6:


    "文一边说着一边扭动着腰。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_42426061:



    voice "d/2RI_1671"
    rin "「文、文……嗯嗯！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_976267df:


    "文用和平时的完全不一样的方式来做。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_d63321c8:



    voice "d/2FU_1262"
    fumi "「哈啊……今天……可以让我……一起有感觉起来吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_ce04af00:



    voice "d/2RI_1672"
    rin "「当……当然啊。那种事……就不用来……问我啦」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_dfdc664f:



    voice "d/2FU_1263"
    fumi "「嗯……没能够……好好地欺负你……真的很抱歉」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_afc1237a:


    "文一边陶醉地蹭擦着私密的裂缝一边细声说着。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_a578dd8f:



    voice "d/2FU_1264"
    fumi "「原本的话……必须得打你的小屁股……才行的……呼啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_ea0992dd:



    voice "d/2RI_1673"
    rin "「哪、哪有什么……必须得打屁股……的道理啦。我、我只是不讨厌……而已」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_e8a1073f:



    voice "d/2FU_1265"
    fumi "「难得在手上绑着的丝带……也只能是变得……看起来很可爱了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_01ab828b:



    voice "d/2RI_1674"
    rin "「呼啊……光是看起来可爱，还不行吗？不……不如说……这完全解不开的啊。你到底是……怎么绑的啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_c5156b2f:


    "文是通过在手机上看那些教人绑绳结的网站学会的。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_58683bc7:



    voice "d/2FU_1266"
    fumi "「啊……原本是打算……把你绑在架子床的梯子上……嗯，让你站着……因为……没有鞭子……就只能……用尺子了……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_29a410c2:



    voice "d/2RI_1675"
    rin "「唏……这比我想象中的还要硬核啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_9acd9fde:



    voice "d/2FU_1267"
    fumi "「诶，可是伦的书里面……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_5a50a417:



    voice "d/2RI_1676"
    rin "「嗯嗯……那是虚构的！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_d09423eb:



    voice "d/2FU_1268"
    fumi "「啊哈……不过今天还是想和伦相连在一起，一起舒服起来……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_91e7f2dc:



    voice "d/2RI_1677"
    rin "「嗯……文竟然有所渴求……真少见。总感觉好开心……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_47f999df:



    voice "d/2FU_1269"
    fumi "「谢谢……伦……我最喜欢你了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_18bb98c9:


    "文猛然地加快了动作的速度，整个房间响彻着粘稠的水声。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_381bd1c8:



    voice "d/2RI_1678"
    rin "「啊、啊啊啊！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_83ea01c5:


    "伦也被翻弄在快感之中。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_171abdf3:


    "伦试图抓住什么东西但却因为双手被绑着而无从下手，只能在这床单的海洋上飘摇着。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_39cb5841:



    voice "d/2FU_1270"
    fumi "「呼啊……唔呜呜呜嗯！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_cf9e5f1f:


    "文也同样沉醉着，醉心于与伦的摆荡之中。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_a1565fab:



    voice "d/2RI_1679"
    rin "「啊……好厉害……文……！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_62217cb0:


    "文丰满的双峰猛烈地摇晃着，双峰之间滑落的汗珠闪耀着亮光。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_01017155:



    voice "d/2FU_1271"
    fumi "「呜……啊啊……伦？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_35690eff:


    "这突如其来超越了自身极限的刺激让文的身子向后仰了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_2d0697c4:


    "不知是有意识的还是因为渴求快感而产生的无意识行动，伦也开始扭动起腰来。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_f0b5382c:


    "两人之间纷乱的动作很快就变得同步起来，使床角发出了嘎吱嘎吱的声音。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_451e3571:



    voice "d/2RI_1680"
    rin "「文……文……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_d7aac8e7:


    "伦发出了哀求般的声音，文听见后很快就明白了其中的含义。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_af3c5955:



    voice "d/2FU_1272"
    fumi "「可……可以的哦……伦……我已经垫了浴巾了……不用憋着……也没关系的哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_d2e5b482:



    voice "d/2RI_1681"
    rin "「嗯……啊、啊啊！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_e738d3a6:


    "伦点头示意着，或许她已经知道无计可施了所以顺从了吧。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_7e0f42d5:



    voice "d/2FU_1273"
    fumi "「啊哈……坦率得……可爱。伦……你变得越来越容易有感觉了。不过今天……可能我才是……扛不住的那一个了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_78161de8:



    voice "d/2FU_1274"
    fumi "「呼啊啊啊……嗯嗯！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_1b94af69:


    "文的身子大幅度地向后仰去。说不定文还是第一次表现得如此手足无措。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_30be2cc4:


    "能感觉到因为这次的事件有了大幅变化的果然还是文。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_5a82dec5:



    voice "d/2RI_1682"
    rin "「啊……嗯嗯唔！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_0eb1a9d5:



    voice "d/2FU_1275"
    fumi "「啊、不行了……就快、要……嗯啊！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_021f8708:


    "两人的声音、躯体和灵魂，在这接近绝顶的时刻融合为一。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_9b7126a1:


    "紧贴的粘膜，让两人的距离变得前所未有的相近。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_d31f0bb0:



    voice "d/2FU_1276"
    fumi "「伦……快点说……你很寂寞啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_2d209ef5:



    voice "d/2RI_1683"
    rin "「文……？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_8d5a6387:



    voice "d/2FU_1277"
    fumi "「快说……你见不到我……感觉好寂寞……吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_d988c038:



    voice "d/2RI_1684"
    rin "「哈啊……嗯……我很寂寞……啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_93c658e1:



    voice "d/2FU_1278"
    fumi "「我也是……我也是啊！不能没有伦……我一定要和伦……在一起」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_ff2ae0a8:



    voice "d/2FU_1279"
    fumi "「唏……呼啊啊啊啊！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_a2502ebd:



    voice sustain
    "率先到达顶峰的是文。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_4e374bec:


    "文体内迸发出的灼热之物以零距离向伦的粘膜倾注而去。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_a0c8899a:



    voice "d/2RI_1685"
    rin "「呼啊……好、好烫……嗯啊……啊啊啊啊啊啊！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_76317d75:


    "伦也抑制不住了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_0e1f08c6:


    "两人颤抖地承受着这强烈的余震。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_8816b702:



    voice "d/2FU_1280"
    fumi "「伦……伦……我最喜欢你了……我想永远……永远……和你在一起！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_af7f7f11:


    "从快感的冲击中缓过神来的两人倾诉着满载爱意的肺腑之言。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_06258d54:



    voice "d/2RI_1686"
    rin "「文……我在……我就在这里……我也同样……不能没有文啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_4d68983f:


    "伦是个麻烦鬼，然而文和她相比也不遑多让。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene06_f206c7b3:


    "两人今后的日子也一定会跌宕起伏的咯♪"
